  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "Given equation: (24 ÷ 6) + (18 × 4) – 54 + 42 = 99\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) **24 and 54**\n\nGiven: (24 ÷ 6) + (18 × 4) – 54 + 42 = 99\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒__** **____**(54 ÷ 6)**__ + __**(18 × 4) **__– 24 + 42 = 99\n\n⇒ __**9 + 72 **__– 24 __**+ 42**__ = 99\n\n⇒ 123 - 24 = 99\n\n⇒ 99 = 99\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\nOption 2) 54 and 42\n\nGiven: (24 ÷ 6) + (18 × 4) – 54 + 42 = 99\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**(24 ÷ 6)**__ +__** (18 × 4)**__ – 42 + 54 = 99\n\n⇒ **__4 + 72 __**- 42** + 54** = 99\n\n⇒ **__130 - 42 = 88__**\n\n⇒ 88 ≠ 99\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) 4 and 6\n\nGiven: (24 ÷ 6) + (18 × 4) – 54 + 42 = 99\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**(24 ÷ 4)**__ + __**(18 × 6)**__ – 54 + 42 = 99\n\n⇒__** 6 + 108**__ - 54 __**+ 42**__ = 99\n\n⇒ **__156 - 54 = 102__**\n\n⇒ 102 ≠ 99\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) 18 and 24\n\nGiven: (24 ÷ 6) + (18 × 4) – 54 + 42 = 99\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**(18 ÷ 6)**__ + __**(24 × 4)**__ – 54 + 42 = 99\n\n⇒ **__3 + 96 __**– 54 __**+ 42** __= 99\n\n⇒ **__141 - 54 = 87__**\n\n⇒ 87 ≠ 99\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
